{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/222959-wod-characters-scientific-breakthroughs-or-insights","id":222959,"title":"Wod-characters scientific breakthroughs or insights","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-09T01:26:39-07:00","id":222959,"title":"Wod-characters scientific breakthroughs or insights","content":"Has your WOD-character reached some innovative scientific breaktroughs or insights with the help of supernatural powers, accumulated knowledge beyond mortal potential over the years and/or lack of ethical hindrances?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1298-the-chronicler","name":"The Chronicler","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T20:15:20-07:00","id":245153,"title":"","content":"A Changeling entered the Dreaming and showed a Mage what he saw of the Distant Cities. (I forget which book they are mentioned. The same one with the Wayfarer's Escheat) The illusionary ones that no Fae can reach. The mage believed the Fae was actually seeing the Horizon Realm. They believe there might be a connection however distant between the Dreaming and Horizon. At least so far in that the realms are... Neighbors in a sense.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-31T09:40:38-07:00","id":245406,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Has your WOD-character reached some innovative scientific breaktroughs or insights with the help of supernatural powers, accumulated knowledge beyond mortal potential over the years and/or lack of ethical hindrances? </div> </div> </div>Thanks to being Embraced into Clan Tzimisce one of NPCs in my chronicle could play at Kindred version of NWoD's Cheiron as she wished. That was actual port of a PC of other player from Hunter: The Vigil, but ported to VtM with certain obvious changes applied.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-31T19:23:21-07:00","id":245773,"title":"","content":"Ermmm....My signature character in W:tA (Ironwolf) was a Metis Glasswalker (his defect was an Extremedly logical and Sociopathic mind)....So..he thought that, concidering how few wolves were around for the Apocalypse..he took the most logical option and....ermm...wanted to create an army of atomic/gnosis impulsed corpses imbued with the spirits of the dead garous so they can fight in the final fight as an army of reanimated corpses a la Lord of The Rings (the ghost king and such)....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-01T12:57:50-07:00","id":246334,"title":"","content":"My longest-running and absolute favorite character is a Mage; he was with the Technocracy (a Watcher for the New World Order), but (partially because I handed my ST a whole bunch of freebie points at character creation and said, &quot;He was orphaned as a baby, do whatever Plot desires with his background&quot;) he eventually discovered that he was Fianna Kinfolk. This caused significant problems with his Technocratic superiors (he was already on extreme probation for -- purely coincidentally -- helping a panicked and terrified Garou escape a Technocratic dragnet in a moment of empathy).<br /> <br /> He officially left the Technocratic Union behind, though he brought with him his ideology and brilliant understanding of the Technocratic and scientific Paradigm. As a member of the New World Order, he had also trained heavily as an anthropologist in college; this left him with an unusual (especially for a Technocratic) understanding and comprehension for unusual paradigms or cosmologies. When he began working more and more closely with Garou, he heard more and more about the Triat and Gaia. Always the curious one, he asked several Theurges and Galliards about them. He received quite a significant amount of information over a long period of time; after thinking on it deeply, he came to a realization.<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh!&quot; He said, &quot;I get it now! The Triat and Gaia -- they are embodiments and expressions of the four fundamental forces! Or, perhaps, the forces are expressions of the Triat and Gaia.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;What the hell are you babbling on about now, Joshua?&quot; Everyone else replied.<br /> <br /> &quot;Here, let me explain.&quot; And then my character proceeded to Unify the Technocratic paradigm with Garou cosmology.<ul><li>The Wyld manifests through the Strong Nuclear Force, which is responsible for ensuring the existence of fundamental building blocks of matter. As the Wyld creates raw materials for Creation, the Strong force confines raw energy into basic particles such as protons. Without the Wyld, there would be nothing brought into creation. Without the Strong force, raw matter could not exist.</li> <li>The Wyrm manifests through the Weak Nuclear Force, which is responsible for the radioactive decay of matter. As the Wyrm breaks down and recycles things after their function has been performed, the Weak force allows for the radioactive decay of unstable elements and particles. After a particle has existed for a long period of time, the interactions of the Weak force gradually increase the likelihood of the particle decaying back into energy and its fundamental constituents.</li> <li>The Weaver manifests through the Electromagnetic Force, which is responsible for the construction of all chemical properties of every form of matter. As the Weaver takes things created by the Wyld and gives them form and function, so too does the Electromagnetic force take the basic particles created by the Strong force and structure them into elements and chemical compounds, dictating the properties of every piece of matter, and how every chemical interacts with every other chemical. It is perhaps no coincidence that virtually all technology created by humanity is dependent, in some manner, on the Electromagnetic force (electricity, optics, radio, even every chemical reaction ever used).</li> <li>Gaia manifests through the Gravitational Force, which is perceived as the weakest of the four fundamental forces, but is the force which has the greatest influence on the evolution of planets, stars, galaxies, and even the Universe. As Gaia holds all things together, and works subtly in the background of the world, so does gravity keep all matter in the Universe bound to all other matter in the Universe. There are theories which postulate that gravity bleeds into other dimensions, which could represent Gaia's presence throughout the Tellurian. Though Gaia and gravity are hardly noticed, and easily defeated in apparent strength by the other forces (a refrigerator magnet can fight against the gravitational influence of the entire planet), they are fundamentally vital to the existence of the world as we experience it.</li> </ul><br /> Some time later, he also (potentially) identified the location of the Wyrm's primary manifestation in the Technocratic cosmology: Sagittarius A*, the supermassive black hole at the center of the Milky Way. He came to this conclusion by the following:<ul><li>The Wyrm is viewed as a &quot;devourer&quot; and &quot;destroyer&quot;, the original purpose of the Wyrm being driven mad and taken to the extreme by its current state of mind. This mirrors a black hole exactly, &quot;consuming&quot; and destroying matter, energy, space, and time, by means of the fundamental forces being &quot;broken&quot; and twisted to extreme levels.</li> <li>While there are many black holes in the galaxy, Sagittarius A* is the largest, which fits the idea of it being the &quot;heart&quot; of the Wyrm.</li> <li>It is located at the center of the galaxy, &quot;bound in the heart of the Weaver's web&quot;.</li> <li>It is virtually impossible to see, hidden behind a vast cloud of gas and dust; this sounds like the Weaver wrapped it up in her web, to keep it bound tightly and out of view.</li> <li>Even beyond the cloud, a black hole has a horizon surrounding it which prevents any light from escaping it; this has the effect of making it invisible. This also fits the idea that the Weaver did not want to &quot;see&quot; the Wyrm and its destruction of her creations, so she abused the Natural Laws under her purview: she could not <i>destroy</i> a black hole, but she could <i>hide</i> it, so she at least didn't have to see them.</li> </ul><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2464-lustral_star","name":"lustral_star","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2464_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"302"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T11:01:54-07:00","id":246952,"title":"","content":"...Damn, that's epic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2214-traveller","name":"Traveller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2214_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T11:13:31-07:00","id":246969,"title":"","content":"lustral_star - Nicely done, and bravo!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/PbrO9Kq.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2211-sixfootchicken","name":"SixFootChicken","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2211_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"559"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T21:55:09-07:00","id":247465,"title":"","content":"Thank you, all! Glad you enjoyed it. Joshua is, as I mentioned, my favorite character; he's had many opportunities to expand his Enlightenment of the Tellurian, and he has taken every challenge as a chance to grow, mentally and spiritually. His combination of the two cosmologies is very representative of his personality and Genius/Avatar/soul.<br /> <br /> Since people liked it, there are a few expansions I can make on the Fundamental-Interactions/Triat-Gaia bit.<ul><li>All four fundamental forces were thought to be combined into a single, Unified Fundamental Force at the creation of the Universe. Shortly thereafter, they split apart into distinct forces. This mirrors some ideas of cosmology in which the Triat came from Gaia, or all four existed together in some unknowable form as (The) One.</li> <li>While Electromagnetism and the Weak Nuclear Force (Weaver and Wyrm) appear to be different forces at normal, everyday energies, they exhibit... unusual interactions at extremely high energy levels / very deep analysis. In these instances, they appear to be fundamentally linked in some way; these energy levels would have been present shortly after the creation of the universe, after the other forces had split. This mirrors some interpretations that the Weaver and Wyrm are linked at some faint and weak metaphysical level.</li> <li>It is most important to know that Gravity (Gaia) is unique and distinct from the other forces (the Triat) in one very special way: there exists no antithesis of it. All other forces have some &quot;opposite&quot; force, demonstrated most prominently by Electromagnetism with the two poles of a magnet. There is one &quot;charge&quot; of a force which attracts the opposite &quot;charge&quot; of the force, and the two can cancel each other out / neutralize. However, gravity (Gaia) does not exhibit this trait. Gravity is only additive. Gravity cannot be canceled out. Gravity cannot be shielded against or transformed in any way. Gravity applies to any form of particle that has mass or moves through space-time, unlike other forces which do not interact with multiple forms of matter or only in some circumstances. Gravity only attracts and pulls together, and never repels or pushes away. Gaia understands that only by embracing her children, may she help them; she must never shun them or push them away, no matter how they might squabble and try to offend her in their immaturity.</li> </ul><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2464-lustral_star","name":"lustral_star","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2464_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"302"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T10:55:44-07:00","id":248014,"title":"","content":"Nice write-up, except I cannot use some of it obviously because my interpretation of the cosmology of Tellurian has it that Gaia is merely one of Celestines. Solar System will eventually die, and the universe still persist on until the heat death of universe. Changing Breeds are not battling for the fate of Tellurian, they are fighting for that tiny blue spot that is insignificant in grand scheme of things. They are fighting for their homeworld which does not diminish any heroic deeds they commit. It's effort and intentions that matter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T11:25:17-07:00","id":248026,"title":"","content":"Well, you don't have to use it. Channeling my inner c0da, your Maybe isn't necessarily my Maybe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2464-lustral_star","name":"lustral_star","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2464_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"302"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T12:07:50-07:00","id":248068,"title":"","content":"Anyway, I at least appreciate the effort you put into the write-up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T12:37:11-07:00","id":248094,"title":"","content":"Lustral, the weak and electromagnetic forces are actually combined into the electroweak force. When the plan is to try and fold one into the other whenever possible, it's probably not a good idea to try and make Triatic correspondences. The Triat is a thing of another kind, one that doesn't have to do with matter, the fundamental forces of another reality.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T13:13:08-07:00","id":248112,"title":"","content":"True, but the electroweak force isn't observable outside of insane energy densities. Anyway, the character was, in the end, just a character, and the metaphysics (and perhaps regular physics) of his world don't quite match up with our own. But you're right, the two DONT mesh perfectly. The exercise was more an attempt to highlight the idea that his cosmology and his allies' cosmology might have a little something in common.<br /> <br /> And thank you, Katsura, it's a pleasure to share and exchange.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2464-lustral_star","name":"lustral_star","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2464_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"302"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T13:07:28-07:00","id":250082,"title":"","content":"The fundamental quest my longest running Son of Ether character (longest running character, period, come to think of it, 3 years plus guest appearances in games I've run) was to exactly duplicate biological matter (Life Sphere) with artificial matter (Matter Sphere) to the point where it was nearly indistinguishable from biological matter. Among the scientific developments he had along the way were very impressive artificial limbs and organs (some that even functioned for Sleepers), highly advanced pharmaceuticals - some of which could work on Kindred (he started with studying them as an example of dead matter that still moved), advanced ballistic materials (cheap alchemical tricks, but again, Sleepers could use some of them), and his (sadly, never to be proven) hypothesis of the Unified Etheric Field Theory which included Gnosis, Glamour, Pathos, Quintessence, etc, etc, etc....all as potential cheaper and cleaner sources of energy. Yeah, the Garou Nation was not happy about that one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}